        "reason": "Material performance patch: the scroll-wheel listener ignores a wheel that cannot move the offset (already at that end, incl. a vertical wheel mapped onto a horizontal-only box): no notify, retained-subtree invalidation or note_scrolled, which repainted the enclosing scroll layer on every wheel event. scroll_max factored out of clamp_scroll_position. A wheel's hover freeze holds hover listeners of any input modality while a frame is drawn, so a row scrolled under a still pointer starts no transition that keeps a list off its layer, and the row under it does not stop hovering (hover_freeze::holds_listeners; docs/ARCHITECTURE.md). A listener is told of hover through hover_freeze::HoveredListener, which tracks it while hovered."
